      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"InventoryManagementSystem-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni uses <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.odoo.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Odoo</a> mostly for Sales Management, Purchase Management, and for Inventory and Accounting. OpenERP has been adapted for health facilities to work seamlessly with Bahmni.</span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"96db54ed-14f8-4907-9387-f01b880132be\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Since Bahmni is based on Odoo/OpenERP, you can also refer to the Odoo documentation for in-depth information on <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.erponline.vn/en/documentation/user-manuals/92-warehouse-management/257-managing-physical-inventory-structure\" rel=\"nofollow\">Warehouse Management</a>. Or here: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://doc.odoo.com/book/#books-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://doc.odoo.com/book/#books-link</a></p></div></div><h2 id=\"InventoryManagementSystem-Steps\">Steps</h2><h3 id=\"InventoryManagementSystem-1.ConfigureOpenERP/Odo\">1. Configure OpenERP/Odo</h3><p>Please <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/21790747/OpenERP+Basic+Configurations\" data-linked-resource-id=\"21790747\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">refer to this link</a> on details to Configure OpenERP/Odoo.</p><h3 id=\"InventoryManagementSystem-2.SetupSyncingbetweenOdooandBahmni\">2. Setup Syncing between Odoo and Bahmni</h3><p>Please <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=114627969\" rel=\"nofollow\">refer to this link</a> to setup Syncing between OpenERP/Odoo and Bahmni.</p><h3 id=\"InventoryManagementSystem-3.ConfigureLocation,WarehouseandShop\">3. Configure Location, Warehouse and Shop</h3><p>Please <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Pharmacy+System#PharmacySystem-5.ConfigureLocation,WarehouseandShop\" rel=\"nofollow\">refer to this link</a> to configure locations, warehouses and shops.</p><h3 id=\"InventoryManagementSystem-4.ViewInventoryatDifferentLocations\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">4. View Inventory at Different Locations</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Since we have different locations we can analyze the current inventory or inventory over a date-range. </span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">To do this navigate to Warehouse → Choose location <span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">→  S</span>elect the required option.</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">A new location can be created by clicking on the &quot;Create&quot; button and giving appropriate parameters.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.31.37.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457434913500&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=334\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.31.37.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457434913500&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"45154334\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-08 at 16.31.37.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014610\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"14\" data-media-id=\"57044889-9bff-4561-aa16-6e82471736f0\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.31.37.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457434913500&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=668 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.31.37.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457434913500&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=334 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Creating a New Location in OpenERP</strong></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 60.0px;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.01.17.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433103694&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=300\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.01.17.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433103694&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"45154330\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-08 at 16.01.17.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014610\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"14\" data-media-id=\"6ac778b5-4605-4018-8518-77bded27887e\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.01.17.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433103694&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=600 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.01.17.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433103694&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=300 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Current Inventory at Pharmacy Location</strong></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" id=\"InventoryManagementSystem-5.ViewProductQuantityataParticularLocation\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">5. View<strong> Product Quantity at a Particular Location</strong></span></h3><p>Search for the product in the search bar to view the actual stock and the future stock for the particular location.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"34a19bde-a51d-4c8f-8ef0-c1d5ebd378e9\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><ul><li>Future stock equals actual stock once the stock units are delivered.</li><li>Drug Orders created in openMRS sync as products in openERP.</li></ul></div></div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" id=\"InventoryManagementSystem-\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.04.43.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433307796&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=143\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.04.43.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433307796&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"45154331\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-08 at 16.04.43.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014610\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"14\" data-media-id=\"076b83a5-c261-490c-9cbc-cc4709425df0\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.04.43.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433307796&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=286 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.04.43.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433307796&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=143 1x\"></span></strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Aceclofenac Stock at Pharmacy Location</strong></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" id=\"InventoryManagementSystem-6.ViewBatchLevelStockUnitsPerLocation\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">6. View Batch Level Stock Units Per Location</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Navigate to &quot;Serial Number by Location&quot; to view batch level stock units per location. </span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"a71a7cee-eda5-4ddc-94a8-ae902796a4db\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">openERP does a double entry of drugs. </span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">For example, when a drug is ordered, it is reduced at the stock location, and increases correspondingly at the customer location so that the drug quantities balance-out.</span></p></div></div><p><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.11.42.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433780533&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=310\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.11.42.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433780533&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"45154332\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-08 at 16.11.42.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014610\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"14\" data-media-id=\"474e466d-8cb2-4ba7-8e30-d90eb8d42d10\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.11.42.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433780533&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=620 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.11.42.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457433780533&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=310 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Batch Level Stock Units of Aceclofenac across Locations</strong></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" id=\"InventoryManagementSystem-7.MoveStockacrossLocations\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">7. Move Stock across Locations</span></h3><p>This is used to move stock units across locations, such as X units of Aceclofenac from Stock Room to Pharmacy. This can be achieved by creating a new internal move from a configured source location to a configured destination location.</p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.21.46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457434328729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=320\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.21.46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457434328729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"45154333\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-08 at 16.21.46.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014610\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"14\" data-media-id=\"6f1777d8-31f5-4f63-820f-0fdc34573259\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.21.46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457434328729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=640 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014610/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-08%20at%2016.21.46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457434328729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=320 1x\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Moving Acyclovir Stock Units Across Locations</strong></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e6921b04-2089-48cb-990e-45bb5d87af22\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-cssliststyle=\"none\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"9670c6f2-8ca8-4529-ae61-a2f8c1ba9ede\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604221/Stock+Inventory+Management\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604221\" data-linked-resource-version=\"15\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Stock / Inventory Management - Feature Guide</a></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b94e3ad7-5c3a-4de1-9e38-0d0d4195b78d\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class